      {
        "id": 52199,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-15T20:58:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you play Inspired Repair during your play phase, it is still your play phase when Inspired Repair allows you to play a card.&nbsp; If Inspired Repair is played (or put into play) outside of your play phase, then it is not your play phase.&nbsp; In the former, you are not allowed to play golems; in the latter you are.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:26:01.806Z",
